        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Thick Door Touchscreen Deadbolts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Touchscreen Deadbolt is the next step in home security. This electronic touchscreen deadbolt can hold up to 19 different codes so that everyone can have their own. It is easy to program, ensuring that only the people who you want to have access to your home do. With a modern appearance perfect for tech-lovers the touchscreen entry door lock is for use on extra thick doors between <b>1-7/8 inches up to 2-1/2 inches</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the DBE375CEN/02007 Thick Door Touch Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>Fingerprint-resistant</li>\r\n<li>Works in the rain and when you’re wearing gloves.</li>\r\n<li>Stores up to 19 four-digit user codes.</li>\r\n<li>LED down lighting illuminates the keypad when needed.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install with just a screwdriver.</li>\r\n<li>3-Year electronics warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime manufacture mechanical finish warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DBE375CEN/02007 Keypad Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Height: 5.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-7/8\" to 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Battery: 2-year battery life with a 9V battery backup.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-BE375-CEN-install-instructions.pdf?v=1704262321\"><b>Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-BE375-CEN-user-guide.pdf?v=1704262322\"><b>User Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: For use with <b>1-7/8\" to 2-1/2\" Thick Doors</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
